# Internal swarm / design paper trail (P9-003).
# npm 10: a package.json `files` allow-list disables .npmignore, so the same
# globs are also negated in package.json `files`. This file documents the
# exclusion set and would apply if `files` were ever removed.
docs/dogfood-swarm-*.md
docs/*-kickoff.md
docs/*dispatch*.md
docs/dogfood-swarm-study-grounding.md
docs/compose-panel-app-design-prompt.md
docs/assets/
docs/.nojekyll
